			"notes": "New in 1.0.4: Phonos support, subtitles, stats, oh my!\n\nAdded in support for FoundationGames wonderful mod, [Phonos](https://github.com/FoundationGames/Phonos)! Now you can use those creative music discs for fun sounds while riding the rails.\nSubtitles will now display in a similar manner to jukeboxes, with the text \"Now playing: Sound Description\" displaying the `MusicDiscItem` description, or if it is a `CustomMusicDiscItem` from Phonos, the subtitle description of the sound, or if not available, the translation name of the phonos music disc item.\n*Music discs played* and *Note blocks tuned* statistics will now increment while using their minecart versions."
